+        beta_bumpA_yP25 y1 y2 y3 y4 y5 y6 >
+      aSpine5 + bSpine5 * dihY y1 y2 y3 y4 y5 y6 := by
+  -- 盒边界换算（mi_two_le_two_hminus : 2 ≤ 2hminus、mi_two_hplus_le_two_sqrt2
